3. Pro Features (license-key gate)
The core Software is free and fully functional within the limits of §2.2;
no license key is required for any core feature. Pro Features require a
valid license key obtained from the Licensor via an optional one-time €5.99
purchase (a fixed-price sale of a digital good — see the EULA). Bypassing,
disabling, circumventing, or assisting others to circumvent the license-key
gate is prohibited. It is likewise prohibited to modify the Software — or
to procure, distribute, or install a modification — so as to enable any Pro
Feature, or to remove or suppress the in-app reminder, without a valid key,
whether or not the license-key gate itself is altered.

